  "version": "1",
  "text": "You have chosen a milky silk dress with delicate sparkles that flows softly to your ankles, paired with a striking multi-layered pearl necklace that adds an elegant touch. Completing the ensemble is a structured beige leather tote bag and matching suede open-toe boots in a soft camel tone, all held together by a warm ginger belt that defines your waistline.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Since the weather is harsh with snow and frost, I suggest wearing a long wool coat over the dress to keep you warm while walking to the office."
  ],
